{"pin":"BH02777","subcodes":[{"code":"BH02777","anchor":"","first_line":"Glorified art Thou, O my God! I beseech Thee by Thy grandeur, through which all things have derived their greatness, and by the effulgent lights of Thy countenance [3.5s]... ...O my God and my Master! I am Thy servant and the son of Thy servant. I have risen from my couch","first_line_orig":"سبحانک اللهم یا الهی اسئلک بعظمتک التی منها استعظم کل شیء و بانوار وجهک  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"320","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#271\"\u003eLL#271\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#470\"\u003eLL#470\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#508\"\u003eLL#508\u003c/a\u003e,  \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#508\"\u003eLL#508\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[{"language":"ko","lang_name":"Korean"},{"language":"sq","lang_name":"Albanian"}],"writing_refs":[{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"tvl","lang_name":"Tuvalu"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"pt","lang_name":"Portuguese"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"it","lang_name":"Italian"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"de","lang_name":"German"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15739.230","source":"BLIB_Or15739","locator":"230"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA49:001","source":"INBA49","locator":"001","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v049/?page